<body>
    <h1>Logic+ Sound Files</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 id=3D"Logic+SoundFiles-ConfiguringPromptFilesinLogic+">Configur=
ing Prompt Files in Logic+</h3>
<p>Prompt files in Logic+ are managed through the Sharpen user interface by=
 administrators with the necessary permissions. These files consist of WAV =
format audio recordings used for pre-recorded messages.</p>
<h4 id=3D"Logic+SoundFiles-UploadingSoundFiles">Uploading Sound Files</h4>
<p>Administrators can upload WAV files directly to the system via the <stro=
ng>Logic+ Prompts</strong> page, where all uploaded sound files are accessi=
ble by navigating Admin =E2=86=92 Configuration =E2=86=92 Logic+, selecting=
 Prompts.</p>
<h4 id=3D"Logic+SoundFiles-FileRequirements">File Requirements</h4>
<p>When uploading prompt files, please ensure they meet the following forma=
t specifications:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>File Type</strong>: WAV</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audio Bitrate</strong>: 8 kbps</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Channels</strong>: Mono</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Sample Rate</strong>: 8000 kHz</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"Logic+SoundFiles-FileNaming">File Naming</h4>
<p>Choose a file name that provides a clear and concise description, making=
 it easy to identify later.</p>
<h4 id=3D"Logic+SoundFiles-CreatingaNewRecording">Creating a New Recording<=
/h4>
<p>To upload a new recording, click the <strong>"New Prompt"</strong> butto=
n and select the desired .wav file for upload.</p><span class=3D"confluence=
-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size=
"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" width=3D"468" loadi=
ng=3D"lazy" src=3D"ee677bcc38f04526e4eed6ba5c96307297262714b0e6ee76240fdf70=
8f74f294" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/a=
ttachments/4209770498/Screenshot%202024-10-16%20at%209.09.38%E2%80%AFAM.png=
?version=3D3&amp;modificationDate=3D1729095309185&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;=
api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"669" data-width=3D"1569" data-unresolved-comment-c=
ount=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4210524162" data-linked-resource-vers=
ion=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-def=
ault-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-16 at 9.09.38=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-ur=
l=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-typ=
e=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4209770498" data-linke=
d-resource-container-version=3D"2" data-media-id=3D"23b82fca-7917-438d-b091=
-2c55aaa8e99c" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"199"></span>
<p>To upload the WAV file, either drag and drop the file into the designate=
d area or click inside the box to browse and select the file.</p><span clas=
s=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embed=
ded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" widt=
h=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"4ac5fd3ced2f87779dfbb0a5c79d1e0be5631c405=
878bc79d9bc90b0816cde72" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/4209770498/Screenshot%202024-10-16%20at%209.09.46=
%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1729095211774&amp;cacheV=
ersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"663" data-width=3D"1559" data-unres=
olved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4209999879" data-linke=
d-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-link=
ed-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-16 at 9.09.46=E2=80=AFAM.pn=
g" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resou=
rce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4209770=
498" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2" data-media-id=3D"38168d38=
-63a7-4842-9362-a49136f4d4bb" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"198"></spa=
n>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p><strong>Note</strong>: While it is easy to manage a few files, we would =
highly recommend agreeing on a naming convention for all of your sound file=
s. The last thing you want to do is struggle to find your file if you have =
hundreds of them.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p><strong>Warning: </strong>This document pertains solely to sound files u=
tilized within Logic+. For information regarding the use of sound files out=
side of Logic+, please refer to the document titled "<a href=3D"https://sha=
rpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/1006141468/Sound+Files" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"1006141468" data-linked-resource-version=3D"3" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"page">Sound Files</a>".</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip=
